WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:09.004
Hey, I'm Dean. I built RepBunny, and thanks for helping me test it.

2
00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:13.928
It's a simple strength log. No account. Your workouts stay on your phone.

3
00:00:14.278 --> 00:00:17.478
Here's all I'm asking. Use it for the next two weeks.

4
00:00:17.841 --> 00:00:22.001
Log your real workouts, or make some up if you're not training right now.

5
00:00:22.358 --> 00:00:25.638
And please stay in the test the whole time.

6
00:00:26.472 --> 00:00:34.872
Oh, and Premium is free for testers. When you unlock it, Google Play should show a test card. If it shows your real card, stop and tell me.

7
00:00:35.222 --> 00:00:39.542
And don't hold back on feedback. The more you send, the better.

8
00:00:39.894 --> 00:00:48.054
If something is confusing, slow, or broken, tap the person icon, then Report a bug. Small stuff counts.

9
00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:51.610
That's it. Have fun, and go lift something heavy.
